{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2021-08-11 13:52:00', 'title': 'LMC SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF MARKETING BETH TUTTLE ACCEPTED INTO FORBES COMMUNICATIONS COUNCIL', 'text': 'DALLAS, AUG. 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 LMC , A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LENNAR CORPORATION AND A LEADER IN APARTMENT DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF MARKETING BETH TUTTLE HAS BEEN ACCEPTED INTO FORBES COMMUNICATIONS COUNCIL. SHE JOINS A RENOWNED GROUP IN THIS INVITATION-ONLY COMMUNITY FOR EXECUTIVES IN COMMUNICATIONS, MARKETING AND PUBLIC RELATIONS.'}